# CalSync Todo - Environment Variables
#
# Google OAuth Client ID
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application type)
# 3. Add authorized JavaScript origins (e.g. http://localhost:5173)
# 4. Add authorized redirect URIs
# 5. Enable Google Calendar API:
#    https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/calendar-json.googleapis.com
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here

# Microsoft Azure AD Client ID (for Outlook integration)
# Set up at: https://portal.azure.com/#blade/Microsoft_AAD_RegisteredApps
VITE_MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=your_microsoft_client_id_here
